abstract: >-
  Raw measurements, per-query results, generated answers, statistical analysis outputs and scripts (S0–S6) of an
  iso-recall, end-to-end comparison of Qdrant 1.20, Weaviate 1.40 and PostgreSQL 16 with pgvector 0.8.7 as the
  retrieval layer of RAG systems.
